{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Animal Game",
    "steam_appid": 2983740,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animal Game is a 2-4 player party brawler where death only makes you stronger! Choose from a large roster of adorable-but-deadly critters, then let the bloodbath commence in local or online multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/366f7e5805a2f14940b3e4c1533e8f4e.poster.avif?t=1745419357\" width=576 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/366f7e5805a2f14940b3e4c1533e8f4e.webm?t=1745419357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/366f7e5805a2f14940b3e4c1533e8f4e.mp4?t=1745419357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What DOES Kill You Makes You Stronger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you eventually die, you get to pick from over 50 elemental upgrades and evolve into an even more ferocious predator. Choose fire to burn your enemies to a crisp, gain ice powers to freeze them into cubes, or mix different elements to gain the upper hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/829280f8c3af9410afde21cdc1106904.poster.avif?t=1745419357\" width=576 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/829280f8c3af9410afde21cdc1106904.webm?t=1745419357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/829280f8c3af9410afde21cdc1106904.mp4?t=1745419357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't Judge a Critter By Its Fluff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On top of the upgrade system, each animal has its own unique playstyle and abilities. As Kitty, you\u2019ll slice and dice in close combat, while Bunny has a double jump for a quick getaway. To set yourself further apart from the herd, you\u2019ll unlock skins as you dominate your enemies in the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Teeth, Claws\u2026 AND GUNS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the bloodshed, weapons will spawn all across the arena \u2014 so be quick on your paws and grab them before your foes do! Blast them full of holes with a sawed-off shotgun, chase them down with an Uzi, or cleave them in half with a giant axe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/321a31f30e0ab0f34a1b0e31c2b05cdb.poster.avif?t=1745419357\" width=576 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/321a31f30e0ab0f34a1b0e31c2b05cdb.webm?t=1745419357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/321a31f30e0ab0f34a1b0e31c2b05cdb.mp4?t=1745419357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mark Your Territory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stages aren\u2019t just for show\u2014they come in various sizes and layouts, offering tons of different play experiences. Each one features its own hazards, interactive elements, and platforms, so you best use the environments to gain the advantage over your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/b5698adbce7969a1214a1a65a5b9f3a8.poster.avif?t=1745419357\" width=576 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/b5698adbce7969a1214a1a65a5b9f3a8.webm?t=1745419357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/b5698adbce7969a1214a1a65a5b9f3a8.mp4?t=1745419357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Place In The Food Chain</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With countless weapons, characters, upgrades, and maps, there\u2019s always something new to master. Whether you're a cub new to the genre or a bloodthirsty tiger with battle scars aplenty, our power-up system ensures that skill gaps won\u2019t get in the way of a fun evening. So gather your friends, pick your favorite cute animal, and battle it out in an intense and bloody fight in Animal Game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animal Game is a 2-4 player party brawler where death only makes you stronger! Choose from a large roster of adorable-but-deadly critters, then let the bloodbath commence in local or online multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/366f7e5805a2f14940b3e4c1533e8f4e.poster.avif?t=1745419357\" width=576 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/366f7e5805a2f14940b3e4c1533e8f4e.webm?t=1745419357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/366f7e5805a2f14940b3e4c1533e8f4e.mp4?t=1745419357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What DOES Kill You Makes You Stronger</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you eventually die, you get to pick from over 50 elemental upgrades and evolve into an even more ferocious predator. Choose fire to burn your enemies to a crisp, gain ice powers to freeze them into cubes, or mix different elements to gain the upper hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/829280f8c3af9410afde21cdc1106904.poster.avif?t=1745419357\" width=576 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/829280f8c3af9410afde21cdc1106904.webm?t=1745419357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/829280f8c3af9410afde21cdc1106904.mp4?t=1745419357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Don't Judge a Critter By Its Fluff</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On top of the upgrade system, each animal has its own unique playstyle and abilities. As Kitty, you\u2019ll slice and dice in close combat, while Bunny has a double jump for a quick getaway. To set yourself further apart from the herd, you\u2019ll unlock skins as you dominate your enemies in the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Teeth, Claws\u2026 AND GUNS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the bloodshed, weapons will spawn all across the arena \u2014 so be quick on your paws and grab them before your foes do! Blast them full of holes with a sawed-off shotgun, chase them down with an Uzi, or cleave them in half with a giant axe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/321a31f30e0ab0f34a1b0e31c2b05cdb.poster.avif?t=1745419357\" width=576 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/321a31f30e0ab0f34a1b0e31c2b05cdb.webm?t=1745419357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/321a31f30e0ab0f34a1b0e31c2b05cdb.mp4?t=1745419357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mark Your Territory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stages aren\u2019t just for show\u2014they come in various sizes and layouts, offering tons of different play experiences. Each one features its own hazards, interactive elements, and platforms, so you best use the environments to gain the advantage over your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/b5698adbce7969a1214a1a65a5b9f3a8.poster.avif?t=1745419357\" width=576 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/b5698adbce7969a1214a1a65a5b9f3a8.webm?t=1745419357\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983740/extras/b5698adbce7969a1214a1a65a5b9f3a8.mp4?t=1745419357\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Place In The Food Chain</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With countless weapons, characters, upgrades, and maps, there\u2019s always something new to master. Whether you're a cub new to the genre or a bloodthirsty tiger with battle scars aplenty, our power-up system ensures that skill gaps won\u2019t get in the way of a fun evening. So gather your friends, pick your favorite cute animal, and battle it out in an intense and bloody fight in Animal Game!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
